l an amphibious assault https://t.co/VpV7Lkv0PV", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2117650779708240355"}, {"author_id": "11348282", "created_at": "2026-11-03T15:00:36.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117633046002225363"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 86, "id": "29472803", "start": 77, "username": "NASAWebb"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/w3Tv1m9Fuf", "end": 231, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/NASA/status/2117633046002225363/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2117633042281836544", "start": 208, "url": "https://t.co/w3Tv1m9Fuf"}]}, "id": "2117633046002225363", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 111, "impression_count": 455202, "like_count": 2151, "quote_count": 41, "reply_count": 172, "retweet_count": 298}, "text": "This smoky specter is the Cat’s Head Nebula, captured in intricate detail by @NASAWebb. Its name comes from its shape, which resembles a cosmic kitty sitting with its back toward the viewer. What do you see? https://t.co/w3Tv1m9Fuf", "url": "https://x.com/NASA/status/2117633046002225363"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-11-03T14:06:42.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117619483288523255"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/MattPrinciple/…", "end": 165, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/MattPrinciple/status/2117615817697509392", "start": 142, "url": "https://t.co/CZUTYFpLuW"}]}, "id": "2117619483288523255", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 1807, "like_count": 26, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117615817697509392", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Uh, no.\n\nIt's not that *females* develop these relationships.\n\nJapanese and Korean men develop parasocial relationships with celebrities too! https://t.co/CZUTYFpLuW", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2117619483288523255"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-11-03T14:05:23.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117619150218465374"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_u