17214422020375019", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "He’s not wrong. This administration has consciously chosen as an actual policy decision NOT to pursue basically *any* pronatal policy, and *instead* to systematically subsidize corrupt billionaires while jacking up prices for regular families through their trade, labor, and https://t.co/eGy7lZbBMQ", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2117597904919519247"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-11-03T12:36:42.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117596833396695067"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/rutgerbregman/…", "end": 255, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/rutgerbregman/status/2117398247044227206", "start": 232, "url": "https://t.co/idj7Rpj2gF"}]}, "id": "2117596833396695067", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 2475, "like_count": 21, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117398247044227206", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "I suspect an audit of my work would turn up very high rates of the AI disagreeing. \n\nFor the same reason the AI always chooses 7. The AI will always flag as an error any deviation from what it perceives as the likeliest next token. https://t.co/idj7Rpj2gF", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2117596833396695067"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-11-03T12:19:24.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117592479306281096"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/sandroambuehl/…", "end": 207, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/sandroambuehl/status/2117592175340814372", "start": 184, "url": "https://t.co/rQS1jylgGK"}]}, "id": "2117592479306281096", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1689, "like_count": 17, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117592175340814372", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "I am well aware of the range of possibilities\n\nBut as a diehard “incentives matter and wages should approximate productivity” guy, this *particular* finding strongly matches my priors https://t.co/rQS1jylgGK", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2117592479306281096"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-11-03T12:11:15.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117590428258336835"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 129, "id": "1887207443257528320", "start": 120, "username": "PeterRFB"}], "urls": [{"description": "Visible engagement with family life by cultural leaders matters for fertility.", "display_url": "ifstudies.org/blog/celebrity…", "end": 222, "expanded_url": "https://ifstudies.org/blog/celebrity-culture-predicted-fertility-decline-in-japan-and-south-korea", "images": [{"height": 500, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2117580938343555072/qijDu_Ct?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1000}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2117580938343555072/qijDu_Ct?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 199, "status": 200, "title": "Celebrity Culture Predicted Fertility Decline in Japan and South Korea", "unwound_url": "https://ifstudies.org/blog/celebrity-culture-predicted-fertility-decline-in-japan-and-south-korea", "url": "https://t.co/9Ac8vHCnVc"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/16LIPWwoDE", "end": 246, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2117590428258336835/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2117590423375855617", "start": 223, "url": "https://t.co/16LIPWwoDE"}]}, "id": "2117590428258336835", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 98, "impression_count": 14317, "like_count": 150, "quote_count": 5, "reply_count": 12, "retweet_count": 15}, "text": "Why did Japan’s fertility have an unusual decline in the 1980s?\n\nWhy did South Korea suddenly drop in the early 1990s?\n\n@PeterRFB suggests a possible explanation, and the kids are not gonna like it.\nhttps://t.co/9Ac8vHCnVc https://t.co/16LIPWwoDE", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2117590428258336835"}, {"author_id": "21436960", "created_at": "2026-11-03T09:59:19.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117557225539383384"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "ESA Open Days 2026 welcomed over 23 000 visitors across its six est...", "display_url": "youtube.com/watch?v=OUyYPz…", "end": 251, "expanded_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OUyYPzytdNU", "images": [{"height": 720, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2117557229243060225/HVc89XNz?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1280}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2117557229243060225/HVc89XNz?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 228, "status": 200, "title": "ESA Open Days 2026", "unwound_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OUyYPzytdNU", "url": "https://t.co/HWn8aa0uFl"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/wiAk5tbk1t", "end": 275, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/esa/status/2117557225539383384/video/1", "media_key": "13_2117556890427138048", "start": 252, "url": "https://t.co/wiAk5tbk1t"}]}, "id": "2117557225539383384", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 7, "impression_count": 13604, "like_count": 105, "quote_count": 8, "reply_count": 8, "retweet_count": 20}, "text": "Over 23 000 visitors joined us for ESA Open Days 2026, exploring our sites, meeting the people behind our missions and discovering Europe’s space activities 🚀\n\nRelive some of the highlights, and stay tuned to join us next year: https://t.co/HWn8aa0uFl https://t.co/wiAk5tbk1t", "url": "https://x.com/esa/status/2117557225539383384"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-11-03T02:45:58.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117448168681996318"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/alz_zyd_/statu…", "end": 273, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/alz_zyd_/status/2117383885826756934", "start": 250, "url": "https://t.co/xasvz4aRe1"}]}, "id": "2117448168681996318", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 21, "impression_count": 8490, "like_count": 186, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 24}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117383885826756934", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "are you telling me that having worker pay more closely tied to worker performance may result in better worker performance and thus higher worker productivity and thus higher net pay?????\n\namazing! who could have predicted such a remarkable thing!?!? https://t.co/xasvz4aRe1", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2117448168681996318"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-11-03T02:44:49.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117447881409917137"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/stanislavfort/…", "end": 293, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/stanislavfort/status/2117176247331496023", "start": 270, "url": "https://t.co/5GaSoSs4iF"}]}, "id": "2117447881409917137", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 4076, "like_count": 43, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117176247331496023", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Classic misunderstanding of economic growth!\n\nYes, you lose the transaction value's profit share for the provider from GDP (income definition).\n\nBut you the customer also save time, which you are likely to deploy to other things, which themselves may involve profitable https://t.co/5GaSoSs4iF", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2117447881409917137"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-11-03T02:25:42.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117443070333444258"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/AlexKrentsel/s…", "end": 104, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/AlexKrentsel/status/2117376683724660898", "start": 81, "url": "https://t.co/Kedq9YjkGi"}]}, "id": "2117443070333444258", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 9, "impression_count": 5480, "like_count": 24, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 2}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117376683724660898", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "i guess we now know why the labs are convinced that ASI is coming extremely soon https://t.co/Kedq9YjkGi", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2117443070333444258"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-11-03T02:24:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117442710931960216"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/Birdyword/stat…", "end": 284, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/Birdyword/status/2117404029835776454", "start": 261, "url": "https://t.co/f5oLFc6Tjm"}]}, "id": "2117442710931960216", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2025, "like_count": 17, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117404029835776454", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "all right but in fairness image and video generators even today, even the frontier ones, still do routinely produce images where the fingers aren't right! it's probably dropped from 85% failure rate to 20% failure rate, but it's still super common to run into! https://t.co/f5oLFc6Tjm", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2117442710931960216"}, {"author_id": "11348282", "created_at": "2026-11-02T22:30:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117383753139925271"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "The NASA MAX POWER tech expo and air show will celebrate flight and space exploration. Join us November 7-8, 2026, at NASA's Kennedy Space Center, Florida.", "display_url": "go.nasa.gov/3V2iiWX", "end": 252, "expanded_url": "https://go.nasa.gov/3V2iiWX", "start": 229, "status": 200, "title": "NASA MAX POWER - NASA", "unwound_url": "https://www.nasa.gov/maxpower/#event-app", "url": "https://t.co/aqD1x7wzRq"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/yxxUw24Nds", "end": 276, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/NASA/status/2117383753139925271/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2117375637358882816", "start": 253, "url": "https://t.co/yxxUw24Nds"}]}, "id": "2117383753139925271", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 31, "impression_count": 351168, "like_count": 688, "quote_count": 8, "reply_count": 47, "retweet_count": 76}, "text": "Planning your trip to MAX POWER? We've got a tool for that.\n\nEvent schedules, maps, and FAQs are at your fingertips with the MAX POWER app. It's free and available to download from official app stores on iOS and Android devices: https://t.co/aqD1x7wzRq https://t.co/yxxUw24Nds", "url": "https://x.com/NASA/status/2117383753139925271"}, {"author_id": "46648807", "created_at": "2026-11-02T21:44:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117372183060025781"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "The guide is designed to help solopreneurs prioritize and implement a selection of actions from the NIST Cybersecurity Framework that would best help their businesses.", "display_url": "nist.gov/news-events/ne…", "end": 278, "expanded_url": "https://www.nist.gov/news-events/news/2026/11/self-employed-solopreneur-nist-has-cybersecurity-guide-just-you", "images": [{"height": 1600, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2117276379955785728/RHxPoxYX?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 2400}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2117276379955785728/RHxPoxYX?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 255, "status": 200, "title": "Self-Employed? Solopreneur? NIST Has a Cybersecurity Guide Just for You", "unwound_url": "https://www.nist.gov/news-events/news/2026/11/self-employed-solopreneur-nist-has-cybersecurity-guide-just-you", "url": "https://t.co/Xxb3SIdUMi"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/IAjChSG7vJ", "end": 302, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/NIST/status/2117372183060025781/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2117372180333756416", "start": 279, "url": "https://t.co/IAjChSG7vJ"}]}, "id": "2117372183060025781", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 4, "impression_count": 2274, "like_count": 13, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 5}, "text": "If you work for yourself, protecting your business from a cyberattack falls entirely on your shoulders. Don’t feel daunted: NIST has just released a guide with your needs — and busy life — in mind. \n\nCheck out our intro to cybersecurity for solopreneurs! https://t.co/Xxb3SIdUMi https://t.co/IAjChSG7vJ", "url": "https://x.com/NIST/status/2117372183060025781"}], "includes": {"users": [{"id": "626660983", "name": "Lyman Stone 石來民 🦬🦬🦬", "username": "lymanstoneky"}, {"id": "11348282", "name": "NASA", "username": "NASA"}, {"id": "21436960", "name": "European Space Agency", "username": "esa"}, {"id": "46648807", "name": "National Institute of Standards and Technology", "username": "NIST"}]}, "meta": {"newest_id": "2117721712397856814", "next_token": "b26v89c19zqg8o3juzlyibi1kq2xmjoj7lyvwvuw79cvx", "oldest_id": "2117372183060025781", "result_count": 25}}
